<title>HONG KONG: HK Aug provisional trade deficit HK$7.2 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Aug provisional trade deficit HK$7.2 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$7.2 billion in August (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			   Aug '96	July '96	Aug '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	  -7.2	    -6.62	  -10.06</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     18.2	    20.80	   20.54</p>
<p> Re-exports	    106.7	   111.15	  100.61</p>
<p> Total exports	 124.9	   131.95	  121.15</p>
<p> Imports		 132.1	   138.57	  131.21</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year-ended -</p>
<p>			   Aug '96	July '96	 Aug '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	 -134.83	 -137.68	  -138.05</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     219.14	  221.50	   232.57</p>
<p> Re-exports	   1,165.22	1,159.15	 1,064.12</p>
<p> Total exports	1,384.36	1,380.64	 1,296.69</p>
<p> Imports		1,519.19	1,518.33	 1,434.74</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
